# Normalize all text files to LF in the index and in the working tree, on every
# platform. Overrides a developer's global core.autocrlf.
#
# Load-bearing, not boilerplate: testdata/regen-cffdrs.sh runs inside a Linux
# container, and a CRLF shebang fails there as `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M`.
* text=auto eol=lf
